# Practice on a compact window (no rails: the Objective / Actions drawers):
# Storm with a typed seed, the Objective drawer, the
# Actions drawer's Pause, the pause screen's Settings (captions, left-handed)
# and Help, resume, undo, a mouse drag steering off the pad to a fall; then the title's Profile, Journey,
# Challenges and Help screens.
# viewport 800x600@1
until 300 Skybound Spring
frames 10
click Practice
until 100 Seed (shareable):
frames 10
click Storm (hard)
frames 5
key Tab 1
frames 5
type {End}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}4242
frames 5
click Start practice run
until 300 Go!
frames 60
click =Objective
until 60 Practice (Storm (hard)): climb as high as you can.
click =Close panel #2
frames 10
click =Actions
until 60 Status
expect Climbing
save practice-drawer
click =Pause (P)
until 60 Undo to last landing (Z)
expect Mode: Practice (Storm (hard))
click Settings
until 60 Color-vision palette
click =Captions (text cues for sounds)
frames 5
click =Left-handed layout
frames 5
save practice-settings
click Back
until 60 Undo to last landing (Z)
click Help
until 60 How to play
expect Thorn clusters (red spikes)
key Escape 2
until 60 Leave run
click ▶ Resume
frames 40
key KeyZ 2
frames 20
save practice-run
drag 70% 40% 20% 40% 30
until 600 Run over
frames 10
expect milestone reached
click Continue
until 100 Journey: 0/40 stages
click Profile
until 60 Achievements
expect Offline — online leaderboards need a StarHermit sign-in.
click Back
frames 10
click Journey
until 60 Mastery gates: 0/5 cleared
save journey-grid
click Back
frames 10
click Challenges
until 60 Sky Sprint
click Back
frames 10
click Help
until 60 How to play
key Escape 2
until 60 Journey: 0/40 stages
